flowchart TB
SSD["SSD / Ubuntu / Docker"] --> Apps["Application data"]
HDD["Local bulk storage"] --> Media["Movies / Music / TV"]
ADATA["ADATA HDD"] --> Archive["Historical/source media"]
Image["Nextcloud storage.img"] --> LUKS["LUKS2"]
LUKS --> Mapper["/dev/mapper/nextcloud-secure"]
Mapper --> EXT4["ext4"]
EXT4 --> Restore["/mnt/nextcloud-restore"]
Apps --> Backup["Backup"]
Media --> Backup
